  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>蘋果樹復甦</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tMdbdeO.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"597\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">描述：</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">新增一項簡單功能，以寫實的方式獲得蘋果。共有兩種樹苗，分別會生成 Minecraft 中現有的兩種蘋果樹：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">「蘋果樹樹苗」與「金蘋果樹樹苗」。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">同時新增一種通用與裝飾用的木材；新增一種名為「翡翠蘋果」的蘋果及其專屬樹種，具有獨特的效果與用途，可在花叢森林與蘋果森林中找到（v2.1+）(1.12.x - 1.17.1)</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">所有檔案請見&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apple-trees-revived/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QHn0Dq0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1097\" height=\"581\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">配方：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">「蘋果樹樹苗」</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HJJ3y04.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"165\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">「金蘋果樹樹苗」</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">(預設為停用，您可於設定檔中啟用此配方)<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1A5uAdY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"167\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">「翡翠蘋果樹樹苗」</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">(預設為停用，您可於設定檔中啟用此配方)</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lHqWmaG.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"166\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">「Notch 蘋果配方」</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">(預設為停用，您可於設定檔中啟用此配方)</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2MHDbBO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"166\"></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">成長階段：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">兩種樹最終都會長成帶有蘋果植株的橡木，這些植株的運作方式類似農作物</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/IvbEik9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"222\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">語言：</span></strong></span><br><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">目前此模組支援 10 種語言：</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>德文 (Deutsch) - de_DE</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>英文 (English) - en_US</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>西班牙文 (Español) - es_MX</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>法文 (Français) - fr_FR</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>日文 (日本語) - ja_JP</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>韓文 (한국어) - ko_KR</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>葡萄牙文 (Português) - pt_BR</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>俄文 (русский) - ru_RU</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>簡體中文 (简体中文) - zh_CN</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>繁體中文 (繁體中文) - zh_TW</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">伺服器使用說明</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">若要在伺服器上使用：</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">- Forge：</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">模組檔案需同時安裝於伺服器端與客戶端方可運行遊戲；由伺服器管理的配方設定於設定檔中（伺服器端）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">- <strong>Fabric：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">模組檔案需同時安裝於伺服器端與客戶端方可運行遊戲（需搭配 Fabric API）；由伺服器管理的配方設定於設定檔中（伺服器端）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>版本紀錄</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>v1.x</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 「原版+」：新增蘋果植株，讓您輕鬆獲取原版蘋果。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 橡樹上結有蘋果。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 簡易掉落物機制。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>v2.x</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 「蘋果擴充」：新增 Minecraft 木材變體 + 全新蘋果種類。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 世界中生成蘋果樹。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 來自木材變體的新方塊。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:90px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- 具備獨特機制的全新蘋果。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">本模組為以下專案的移植版：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apple-trees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apple-trees</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\">&nbsp;</p>",
